# What the source distribution carries beyond the package itself. README and
# LICENSE arrive on their own, named by `readme` and `license-files`.
#
# The test suite is deliberately absent: `test_docs.py` and `test_mkdocs.py`
# build this repository's own site, so shipping the suite without `doc/` and
# `mkdocs.yml` would ship a suite that cannot pass. Gates are run from a
# checkout, not from an sdist.
include CHANGELOG.md

# The runnable fixture the README tells a new reader to lint first. 60K, and it
# is the only way `hmd lint --root examples/small` works straight out of the
# archive.
recursive-include examples *.hmd *.md *.toml
